# Root-owned allowlist.  Install as root:root, mode 0600 (or 0400).
#
# Format: profile|controller-name|wpa-network-id|exact-SSID
# The controller compares the configured wpa_supplicant ID with this exact SSID
# before it unblocks Wi-Fi.  No PSK belongs in this file.
#
# Add the current numeric ID for this already-saved network during activation:
# profile|shmecklebucket|0|shmecklebucket
#
# Do not add an iPhone line until the owner supplies its exact local SSID:
# profile|iphone-hotspot|1|EXACT LOCAL HOTSPOT SSID
